<Base
  title="About This Site — Clacton By-Election 2026"
  description="Who runs clactoncandidates.co.uk, our neutrality policy, our sources, and how to request a correction."
>
  <h1>About this site</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    clactoncandidates.co.uk is an independent voter-information site for the
    2026 Clacton by-election. It exists to put the basic facts — who is
    standing, what they say, when and how to vote — in one fast, plain place.
  </p>

  <h2>Neutrality</h2>
  <p>
    This site is not affiliated with, funded by, or coordinated with any
    political party, candidate or campaign. It does not endorse anyone. We
    aim to describe every candidate and party in neutral terms, present
    candidates' positions in their own words wherever possible, and give the
    same treatment to each. Where events are contested — such as the
    circumstances of the by-election — we report both the allegations and the
    responses, with sources.
  </p>

  <h2>Sources and accuracy</h2>
  <p>
    Factual claims are cited at the point they are made. Primary sources for
    election administration are the <a href="https://www.electoralcommission.org.uk/" rel="noopener">Electoral Commission</a> and <a href="https://www.tendringdc.gov.uk/" rel="noopener">Tendring District Council</a> (the
    returning authority). Candidate data is cross-checked against <a href="https://whocanivotefor.co.uk/" rel="noopener">WhoCanIVoteFor</a> (Democracy
    Club) once nominations are published. Reporting on the events
    that led to the by-election draws on coverage by the New Statesman, LBC,
    The Scotsman, GB News and others, linked where used.
  </p>

  <h2>Corrections</h2>
  <p>
    If anything on this site is wrong or out of date, we want to fix it
    quickly. Email <a href="mailto:corrections@clactoncandidates.co.uk">corrections@clactoncandidates.co.uk</a> with
    a link to the page and, ideally, a source.
  </p>

  <h2>For candidates and agents</h2>
  <p>
    If you are standing in the by-election and would like your entry updated —
    a photo, a short statement, key positions, campaign links —
    email <a href="mailto:candidates@clactoncandidates.co.uk">candidates@clactoncandidates.co.uk</a>.
    Every candidate on the ballot is offered the same space on the same terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    This site sets no cookies and collects no personal data. We measure
    visitor numbers with <a href="https://plausible.io/" rel="noopener">Plausible</a>,
    a privacy-focused analytics tool that uses no cookies, stores no personal
    information, and does not track you across other sites. Everything else is
    a set of static pages.
  </p>
</Base>
